"def reference(vectors):\n    p=0\n    o=0\n    r=0\n    i=0\n    a=[]\n    for row in vectors:\n        if \"reset\" in row:\n            r=row[\"reset\"]&1\n        if \"in\" in row:\n            i=row[\"in\"]&0xffffffff\n        if r:\n            o=0\n        else:\n            o=(o|(p&(~i)))&0xffffffff\n        p=i\n        a.append({\"out\":o&0xffffffff})\n        m=row.get(\"mid\")\n        if m:\n            if \"reset\" in m:\n                r=m[\"reset\"]&1\n            if \"in\" in m:\n                i=m[\"in\"]&0xffffffff\n    return a\n"
